        ":question/problem": "$$\nP=[\\begin{aligned}\\bbox[lightgray, 2pt]{0} & -2 & 2 \\\\ 2 & 0 & -2 \\\\ -2 & 2 & 0\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nIn index notation, the highlighted entry of the matrix $P$ above is ${p}_{ij},$ where$\\,$\n\n$i=$\n\n{{field-1}}\n\nand\n$j=$\n\n{{field-2}}\n\n.",
